# No redirects defined here. www -> apex canonicalization is handled by
# a Cloudflare Redirect Rule at the zone level (dashboard -> Rules ->
# Redirect Rules) once DNS is on Cloudflare, not by this file.
#
# An earlier version tried:
#   https://www.wallinstall.ca/*  https://wallinstall.ca/:splat  301
# which broke the build: "Invalid _redirects configuration: Line 1: Only
# relative URLs are allowed. [code: 100324]". _redirects sources must be
# relative paths, and even a relative-source rule here would apply to
# every hostname this project serves (including the apex itself),
# causing a redirect loop -- hence handling this at the zone level instead.
